  "name": "Three-Live (AI-generated Three.js to native 3D, AR & WebXR)",
  "summary": "Open-source library + sandboxed on-device compiler from Google that runs LLM-generated procedural Three.js safely and renders it natively: WebGL2/WebXR on web, Filament/Scene Viewer on Android, RealityKit/Quick Look on iOS, with GLB/USDZ export. Includes browser playgrounds (<three-live> studio, <xr-live> spatial studio).",
